## ✅ Summary

| Goal                    | Command / File                                    |
| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |
| Build from local binary | `nix-build default.nix`                           |
| Install system-wide     | Add `callPackage` to `environment.systemPackages` |
| Use flakes              | Define in `flake.nix` and run `nix build .#name`  |
| Fix missing libs        | Add `autoPatchelfHook` + dependencies             |
| Verify                  | Run `ldd result/bin/mybinary`                     |

